    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        199,
        1478,
        1495,
        1681
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. Notwithstanding Section 1 of Executive Order No. 29, dated March 16, 2023, the Chief Housing Officer, established pursuant to Sections 1 and 8 of such Order, shall act as and constitute the designated Deputy Mayor, for the purpose of serving on the Board of Trustees of the New York City Public Housing Preservation Trust, in accordance with subdivision 2 of section 628 of the Public Housing Law.",
